%% ============================================================================
%% Diagram 4 - CI/CD pipeline
%% Purpose: how a commit becomes a deployed, verified application
%% ============================================================================
flowchart TD
    DEV[Developer] -->|git push to main| GH[GitHub]
    GH -->|triggers Deploy workflow| CH[Checkout]
    CH --> AWS_CREDS[Configure AWS credentials<br/>GitHub secrets]
    AWS_CREDS --> TEST[Backend tests + npm audit]
    TEST --> LOGIN[ECR login]
    LOGIN --> BUILD[Build + push backend image]
    LOGIN --> BUILDF[Build + push frontend image]
    BUILD --> SCAN[Trivy scan CRITICAL/HIGH]
    BUILDF --> SCANF[Trivy scan CRITICAL/HIGH]
    SCAN -->|pass| DEPLOY
    SCANF -->|pass| DEPLOY
    DEPLOY[Update SSM image params<br/>+ start ASG instance refresh]
    DEPLOY --> SMOKE[Smoke test against ALB]
    SMOKE -->|healthy| DONE[Deployed ✓]

    FAIL[Scan finds issues] --> BLOCK[Pipeline fails - nothing deployed]

    TRIVY_TRIGGER[PR / push to develop] --> CI
    subgraph CI[CI workflow]
        A[Unit tests] --> B[Frontend build] --> C[Docker build] --> D[Trivy scan] --> E[Terraform validate]
    end